      "system": {
        "active": true,
        "description": "<p>You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is Heavilyobscured. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by <em>Gust of Wind</em>) disperses it.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The fog's radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1.</p>",
